      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think the most likely way this could be implemented, is Udon will get this not if the user is age verified but if the user is in a age verification gated instance. This way, they don't have to worry about every world just using this info. And this will probably make it easier for world devs to implement checks without worrying about ensuring triggers only trigger for the verified people while staying synced. Without having to implement manual sync essentially.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
